Reconstruction: pack content is synthesized orientation notes from RG 1.28
Rev 6 facts pinned to the Federal Register issuance notice. Verbatim excerpts
of RG 1.28 text are capped at two sentences. This pack contains zero
quotations from ASME NQA-1: that standard is ASME copyright, is named with
